## Description

AI agents at Kavak sell the cars, underwrite the loans, coach the mechanics, and in one Mexican city, run the entire operation.  The Latin American used-car marketplace bet on agents three years ago. Today ~95% of interactions and transactions run end-to-end on AI: NPS tripled, https://t.co/hK64T9u9z4

